title: SkylerClue0
---
<<play_animation Skyler Skyler_Yell>>
Skyler: Theo punched me in the face!! He walked right up to me and punched me, in! The! Face! 
<<play_animation Skyler Skyler_Freeze>>
Skyler: I was only fighting back in self-defense. He shouldn’t be allowed to be the lead. I demand you remove him and recast at once. #line:skyler_drama_club_C00
===

title: SkylerClue1
---
Skyler: My mom is on the PTA! She helps out in the drama club too and does all our makeup. Isn’t that cool? #line:skyler_drama_club_C01_01
<<play_animation Skyler Skyler_Smirk>>
Skyler: You wouldn’t want to expel the kid of one of your most generous volunteers, would you? #line:skyler_drama_club_C01_02
===

title: SkylerClue2
---
<<play_animation Skyler Skyler_Smirk>>
Skyler: I can explain this, it’s just for the show. In fact, I can do your makeup for you! I know how to do a great smokey eye! I’ve got plenty of colors, look! #line:skyler_drama_club_C02
===


title: TheoClue0
---
Theo: Skyler came out of nowhere and punched me in the face. He already had a black eye when he punched me, swear on my life, I don’t know how he got it. I didn’t lay a hand on him. #line:theo_drama_club_C00
===

title: TheoClue1
---
<<play_animation Theo Theo_Tea>>
Theo: I’ve been taking voice lessons! I used to be too nervous to sing in front of people, but I’ve really worked on my confidence and I think it’s paying off. #line:theo_drama_club_C01_01
Theo: I need to take good care of my vocal chords. Did you know honey helps soothe inflammation? #line:theo_drama_club_C01_02
===

title: TheoClue2
---
<<play_animation Theo Theo_Script>>
Theo: I got the lead in the the play! I know Skyler usually gets the lead, but this time it’s finally my turn. #line:theo_drama_club_C02
===


title: DramaClubSuccess
---
Theo: I’m glad you didn’t fall for his acting, Principal Judge. 
<<play_animation Theo Theo_Script>>
Theo: I better get back to the rehearsal. You’ll come see the show, right? Oh, by the way... #line:drama_club_success_01
<<play_animation Theo Theo_Freeze>>
Theo: I don’t mean to be a tattletale, but the day before Pork Pie went missing, I saw Skyler lurking around the corridor where Pork Pie’s storage room is. #line:drama_club_success_02
Theo: He sure spent a lot of time pacing back and forth, and even tested out the doorknob of the room. Do you think he might have taken poor Pork Pie? #line:drama_club_success_03
<<next_case GameManager>>
===

title: DramaClubFailure
---
Superintendent: Bad call, Judge. A kid in the drama club just dropped the act and admitted they saw Skyler applying makeup to fake a black eye before attacking Theo! He thought getting Theo suspended might give him another shot at the star role. #line:drama_club_failure_01
Superintendent: You fell for it and caught the wrong kid! Don’t make me recast your role as Principal... #line:drama_club_failure_02
<<next_case GameManager>>
===